| TC02 Bidirectional traceability | 2, 4, 14, 15 | Requirement to design, task and acceptance, reverse source, orphan and conflict handling | KB10, KB11 |
| TC03 Module responsibility | 3, 4, 6 | Responsibility, boundaries, inputs and outputs, owners, dependencies, failure and lifecycle ownership | KB01–KB18 module responsibilities as applicable |
| TC04 Interface contracts | 4, 5, 9, 13 | Agreement on types, limits, errors, permissions, versions, timeouts and duplicate behavior | KB04, KB06, KB13, KB16 |
